<title>USA: IPO PRICING - Aurora prices within range. [CORRECTED 16:55 GMT]</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - Aurora prices within range. [CORRECTED 16:55 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects from &quot;below range&quot; to &quot;within range&quot;.)</p>
<p>   Company Name	  Aurora Biosciences Corp</p>
<p>   Priced At					 $10</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range		$9 - $11</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			4,000,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter	Alex Brown &amp; Sons Inc</p>
<p>NOTE: The proposed number of shares were raised for the planned initial public offering in Aurora Biosciences Corp to four million shares from three million shares originally.</p>
